    "title": "Project Owner Ordinary Variables",
    "version": "0.1.0",
    "description": "Initialized Project current Human Owner only; no administrator bypass. Active mutations, initialized archiving/archived read/Lookup/completed replay; pending/deleting reject. Not Secret/Agent/runtime injection. Request/detail/mutation/Lookup 1 MiB, summary list 5 MiB. Exact UTF-8 byte caps, duplicate members, Unicode scalar validity, canonical version/ID, sorting, presence and cross-field version/identity/time checks are enforced by Go in addition to this schema. Delete preserves historical ordinary values in command receipts and does not promise erasure. Freeze the original key/body/ID/version before sending; not_observed/current GET is not commit proof."
